  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 102.38 Conservation area",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 102.38 “Conservation area” means an area of land legally protected so as to restrict the future use or development of the property in perpetuity, such as by a conservation easement.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100) #12801, eff 12-15-19; renumbered by #13945 (formerly Env-Wt 102.36)",
